      "statement": "Headless (non-interactive) mode reuses the same agent runtime and RemoteAgent client, running a single user task inside the same `langgraph dev` server subprocess but swapping the terminal interface for machine-friendly stdout streaming, with an optional quiet mode that leaves only the agent's response text.",
